  "private": true,
  "description": "FluentFeed is an \"addictive\" language-learning platform that reimagines pronunciation practice through the lens of short-form social media. By merging the high-engagement, infinite-scroll UI of Instagram Reels with advanced AI-driven speech analysis, FluentFeed forces active vocal participation in every \"scroll.\"",
